IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pa-patents`

-- Patents Act 1994, ss 13 to 16, 34, 36, 39, 49, 50, 66, 69, 71, 77, 98 to 100 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_patents-act-1994.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`an R&D engineer's invention on the job` MEANS EmployeeInvention WITH
    `mainly employed in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `not mainly employed anywhere` IS FALSE
    `attached to the employer's Singapore place of business` IS FALSE
    `made in the course of normal duties` IS TRUE
    `made in the course of specifically assigned duties` IS FALSE
    `an invention might reasonably be expected to result` IS TRUE
    `made in the course of duties` IS FALSE
    `had a special obligation to further the employer's interests` IS FALSE

